TRUEOS modifications:
- Decoder-only no_std + alloc package; encoder source/module not included.
- std IO -> core3::io, std core types -> core, collections -> alloc::BTreeMap.
- Private core3 ReadBytesExt uses no_std byteorder-lite primitives.
- quick-error replaced with equivalent error variants, Display and From<io::Error>.
- No std compatibility shim, host codec, C library or network access.
- Entropy scratch rejects more than 256 Huffman groups; VP8 declared partitions
  above 8 MiB reject before allocation. Decode algorithms otherwise remain intact.
